WEBPAGE: engineering.purdue.edu_TPAN_people

 Interdisciplinary Training Program in Auditory Neuroscience Overview
The Interdisciplinary Training Program in Auditory Neuroscience (TPAN) at Purdue University focuses on advancing research and education in auditory neuroscience. The program is designed to foster collaboration among various disciplines to enhance understanding of auditory processing and related technologies.


