The schedule for CS 34800: Information Systems in Spring 2026 is as follows:  ### Week 1 —
Introduction to Relational Databases - **Indianapolis Classes**:    - January 12, 2026   - January
14, 2026 - **West Lafayette Classes**:    - January 13, 2026   - January 15, 2026 - Topics: Course
logistics, Relational data model, Introduction to SQL.  ### Week 2 — SQL Fundamentals -
**Indianapolis**: January 19 & 21, 2026 (Note: No class on January 19, 2026 - MLK Day) - **West
Lafayette**: January 20 & 22, 2026 - Topics: SQL joins, set operators, SQL subqueries.  ### Week 3 —
Advanced SQL - **Indianapolis**: January 26 & 28, 2026 - **West Lafayette**: January 27 & 29, 2026 -
Topics: SQL views, NULL values, updates, stored procedures.  ### Week 4 — Relational Algebra -
**Indianapolis**: February 2 & 4, 2026 - **West Lafayette**: February 3 & 5, 2026  ### Week 5 —
Cloud Databases and SQL Security - **Indianapolis**: February 9 & 11, 2026 - **West Lafayette**:
February 10 & 12, 2026  ### Week 6 — Database Design - **Indianapolis**: February 16 & 18, 2026 -
**West Lafayette**: February 17 & 19, 2026  ### Week 7 — ER Model, Functional Dependencies,
Normalization - **Indianapolis**: February 23 & 25, 2026 - **West Lafayette**: February 24 & 26,
2026  ### Week 8 — Storage and Indexing - **Indianapolis**: March 2 & 4, 2026 - **West Lafayette**:
March 3 & 5, 2026  ### Week 9 — Midterm Examination - **Indianapolis**: March 9 & 11, 2026 - **West
Lafayette**: March 10 & 12, 2026   - Midterm Exam 1: March 10, 2026, from 8:00 PM to 9:30 PM.  ###
Week 10 — Spring Break - No classes: March 16-19, 2026.  ### Week 11 — Storage, Indexing, and NoSQL
- **Indianapolis**: March 23 & 25, 2026 - **West Lafayette**: March 24 & 26, 2026  ### Week 12 —
NoSQL Databases - **Indianapolis**: March 30 & April 1, 2026 - **West Lafayette**: March 31 & April
2, 2026  ### Week 13 — Transactions and Isolation - **Indianapolis**: April 6 & 8, 2026 - **West
Lafayette**: April 7 & 9, 2026  ### Week 14 — Analytical Databases - **Indianapolis**: April 13 &
15, 2026 - **West Lafayette**: April 14 & 16, 2026  ### Week 15 — Distributed Databases -
**Indianapolis**: April 20 & 22, 2026 - **West Lafayette**: April 21 & 23, 2026  ### Week 16 — Final
Assessments - **Indianapolis**: April 27 & 29, 2026 - **West Lafayette**: April 28 & 30, 2026   -
Midterm Exam 2: April 27, 2026, from 8:00 PM to 9:30 PM.  This schedule is tentative and subject to
change. Please keep an eye on course announcements for any updates.
